//    No link is shown: the cards are not <a href> elements (nothing in the status bar on hover), they navigate by script.
//  * #PartsAdminTab: the add / edit / AI controls were removed from the public watch page. They live in the new admin tab "Parts"
//    (Admin > Parts): add a part section (group name + search videos + optional part no.), rename / delete groups, remove a video,
//    AI re-detect, scan the whole library, Automatic AI detection switch. The watch page shows an admin-only shortcut that opens it in a NEW tab.
