// FACEBOOK DIRECT INSTANT "FUTURE" BUILD - what changed in this version
//  * #FbiFuture (Direct Instant mode only; no Service Worker; best-effort, never blocks playback; switch: FBI_BOOST_ENABLED):
//    - #FbiNextWarm: predictive next-episode warm. Past ~60 % (or the last 3 min) the next episode's raw CDN URL is resolved,
//      saved (same fbi:u:<id>:auto key the watch page / gallery already read) and its CDN connection opened.
//    - #FbiResumeSeed: gallery "Continue watching" predictive warm. On idle time, up to 3 half-watched videos on the page get
//      their raw CDN URL resolved + connection opened, so the click starts from a known-good URL.
//    - #FbiDataSaver: Data-Saver / 2G aware - lighter preload on the watch page, no background warming at all.
//    - #FbiNetHeal: neon chips "Offline" / "Back online" + a gentle nudge that restarts a stalled download (never touches a
