// SEARCH SNIPPET FIX - what changed in this version
//  * #SnippetFix: Google showed the <noscript> "needs JavaScript" warning as the search-result description, because pages had no
//    meta description. shell() now adds a default <meta name="description"> (skipped when the page already sets one, e.g. watch
//    pages with ogMetaTags) and the no-JS warning carries data-nosnippet so it is never used as a snippet.
// ============================================================================
