//    with the same headers the working search uses, one retry, only a real sign-in redirect = "login expired", other failures are
//    temporary (retry after 30 min, stop after 8). The cron fallback rotation no longer throws and no longer wipes the page-token cache.
//  * #MicFix: voice search - the last spoken words were lost when pressing Search; an old query was searched again when nothing was
