//    (server guard: 409 unless allowDuplicate). GET /api/admin/movie-suggest?q=Name 2002[&check=1]
//  * #AiMode: AI search has two modes. AUTO = pick a suggestion and DeepSeek fills everything by itself (date,
//    poster, genres, language mode, description). MANUAL = the admin chooses the language mode and the AI never
//    overrides it. The AI is also handed the list of already-created categories and must choose from them first.
//  * #MultiLang: language modes are now Tamil, English, Hindi, Telugu, Malayalam, Kannada (LANG_MODE_LIST - add
//    more there). Categories / years only appear in a mode if a PUBLISHED video of that mode is inside them.
//  * #HideEmptyCats: categories, sub-categories and years with no PUBLISHED video are hidden from the public site
//    (draft / hidden / trash videos do not count). The admin still sees everything.
//  * #DraftMode: "Save as draft" and "Publish" buttons in the Add form (draft needs only a title - the video ID can come
